"Rules changed after preview; no new rules remain. Return to input and preview again. Nothing was imported." = "预览后规则已发生变化，已无可新增的规则。请返回编辑并重新预览，未导入任何规则。";
"The Hosts download exceeds the 2 MiB limit." = "下载的 Hosts 文件超过 2 MiB 大小限制。";
"The Hosts download failed. Check the URL and your connection." = "Hosts 文件下载失败。请检查链接和网络连接。";
"The Hosts download redirected too many times (maximum 5)." = "Hosts 下载的重定向次数过多（最多允许 5 次）。";
"The Hosts download was cancelled." = "已取消下载 Hosts 文件。";
"The URL returned an HTML page. Use a direct raw Hosts file URL, not a web page." = "此链接返回的是 HTML 网页。请使用直接指向原始 Hosts 文件的链接，而不是网页链接。";
"The downloaded Hosts file is empty." = "下载的 Hosts 文件为空。";
"The server did not return HTTP 200. Use a direct raw Hosts file URL." = "服务器未返回 HTTP 200。请使用直接指向原始 Hosts 文件的链接。";
"The server returned an invalid response." = "服务器返回了无效的响应。";
"This downloader can only be used once." = "此下载器只能使用一次。";
"Will add: %lu\nAlready covered: %lu\nConflicting rules kept: %lu\nDuplicate entries: %lu\nRedirect lines skipped: %zu\nLocal names skipped: %zu\nInvalid lines / names: %zu / %zu\nBlank / comment lines: %zu\nTotal global rules after import: %lu / %d\n\nIMPORTANT\n• This converts a blocklist, not system Hosts or DNS redirection.\n• Existing domain/www rules are never overwritten. The current engine matches www aliases and may block shared IPs from DNS results.\n• Global rules override app rules and the iOS system-process allowance. Other existing IP/domain rules may take precedence.\n• Domain rules trigger DNS lookups. Large lists can take a long time to resolve and increase background work. IP-only connections rely on short-lived DNS caches; coverage can be delayed or incomplete. Saving rules does not verify filtering.\n• Only new connections are affected. Firewall must already be enabled. This import does not change Firewall, Default Rule or notification settings.\n• Export your existing rules first if you need a record; this version has no one-tap batch undo.\n\nADDED DOMAINS\n" = "将新增：%lu\n已有屏蔽规则：%lu\n保留冲突规则：%lu\n重复条目：%lu\n跳过重定向行：%zu\n跳过本地主机名：%zu\n无效行 / 主机名：%zu / %zu\n空行 / 注释行：%zu\n导入后全局规则总数：%lu / %d\n\n注意事项\n• 此操作转换的是屏蔽列表，不修改系统 Hosts，也不执行 DNS 重定向。\n• 不覆盖已有的同名域名或 www 别名规则。当前引擎会匹配 www 别名，也可能根据 DNS 结果屏蔽共享 IP。\n• 全局规则优先于应用规则及 iOS 系统进程放行设置；其它已有 IP / 域名规则仍可能优先生效。\n• 域名规则会触发 DNS 查询。大型列表解析较慢，也会增加后台负担。仅含 IP 的连接依赖短期 DNS 缓存，覆盖可能延迟或不完整。保存成功不代表已验证拦截效果。\n• 仅影响新连接，防火墙需已开启。本次导入不改变防火墙开关、默认规则或通知设置。\n• 如需留档，请先导出已有规则。本版本尚无整批导入的一键撤回功能。\n\n新增域名\n";
"No Hosts blocking entries were recognized. Surge DOMAIN/SUFFIX/KEYWORD rules and plain domain lists are not Hosts files; they are not converted automatically.\n" = "未识别到 Hosts 屏蔽条目。Surge 的 DOMAIN / SUFFIX / KEYWORD 规则和纯域名列表不是 Hosts 文件，不会自动转换。\n";
"Working…" = "处理中…";
